ent/uploads/wppa/156.jpg"},{"caption":"literal image URL in page","url":"https://www.markallenshepherd.com/wp-content/uploads/wppa/172.jpg?ver=1"},{"caption":"literal image URL in page","url":"https://www.markallenshepherd.com/wp-content/uploads/wppa/172.jpg"}],"page":"https://www.markallenshepherd.com/photo-galleries/photos-of-mark/","source_response_path":"documents/bfb1f8df7bd23824d87f78a250c6da266b82ba5464f041165af97f9e8cdce39b.html","source_response_sha256":"bfb1f8df7bd23824d87f78a250c6da266b82ba5464f041165af97f9e8cdce39b","text":"Photos of Mark - Mark Allen Shepherd\nSkip to content\nHome Page\nBlog\niMDB\nMorn Facts\nMark Facts\nMarks Videos\nLinks\nPhoto Galleries\nPhotos of Mark\nLast Day on Set of DS9\nArtwork by Fans\nConvention Photos\nDragonCon2000\nShop\nCart\nCheckout\nMy account\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nMenu Cart\nMenu Cart\nMenu Cart\nMenu\nSearch for:\nPhotos of Mark\nTo see the full size images, you need to enable javascript in your browser.\nRandom Photo\nCategories\nArticles\nLiterary Works\nMark's Videos\nNews Letter\nWebsite\nMeta\nLog in\nEntries feed\nComments feed\nWordPress.org\nAbout\nMark Allen Shepherd\nplays Morn, a humanoid alien from the Ionite Nebula that frequents the space station at Deep Space Nine. He’s found to be quite the regular at Quark’s bar. Morn is a ladies man, even Dax has commented that she finds the few hairs on the top of Morn’s head attractive.\nSiteMap\nHome\n•\niMDB\n•\nMark Facts\nMarks Videos\n•\nMorn Facts\nPhoto Galleries\n•\nStore\n•\nLink\nSite Design\nAnother Site Designed & Maintained\nby:\nRonald F. Garrison\nPowered By:\n© 1996-2026 Mark Allen Shepherd - All Rights Reserved","title":"Photos of Mark - Mark Allen Shepherd"}
